    "name": "Evaluate an arithmetic formula",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Expression precedence is explicit: 2 + 3 * 4 = 14. This actual compiled Formula service has no free variable.\n\nExpression precedence is explicit: 2 + 3 * 4 = 14. This actual compiled Formula service has no free variable.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.formula.evaluation@1; compiled owned-value service.\nExpected:\noutput-result (f64) = 14\noutput-error (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\n",
